Project 1: Credit Risk Prediction

Industry: Banking / Financial Services

Business Problem: Estimate the likelihood that a loan applicant may default based on historical applicant and loan data.

Implementation:

Process applicant, financial, and historical repayment data.

Engineer relevant features and handle class imbalance.

Build classification models using Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and XGBoost.

Evaluate precision, recall, ROC-AUC, and probability calibration.

Analyze feature importance and model explainability.

Build a prediction API for loan-risk assessment.

Expected Outcome: Support risk assessment with consistent, measurable model predictions.

Technologies: Python, SQL, Pandas, Scikit-learn, XGBoost, SHAP, FastAPI
